hpc:Preexeccommand a owl:Class .
hpc:Postexeccommand a owl:Class .
hpc:Resizenotificationcommand a owl:Class .
hpc:pids a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .
hpc:exitcode a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .
hpc:exitreason a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:interactive a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .


This ontology fragment defines classes for pre-execution command, post-execution command, resize notification command, and a job. It also declares datatype properties for PID number, exit code, exit reason, and interactive status, and specifies their domains and ranges.
